<title>ESTONIA: TARTU TO ISSUE NEW COMMERCIAL PAPERS. [CORRECTED 13:59 GMT]</title>
<headline>TARTU TO ISSUE NEW COMMERCIAL PAPERS. [CORRECTED 13:59 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tartu city government will issue six-month commercial papers worth 23 million kroons on May 26 (corrects day of issue), Hoiupank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The commercial papers, which will be used to refinance the previous issue, have a yield of 8.2 percent, Hassar Kipp of Hoiupank told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
